WEBVTT

00:08:58.516 --> 00:09:02.076
Now if we do that,

00:09:02.076 --> 00:09:05.676
perhaps we could become
a league of solutionists

00:09:05.676 --> 00:09:08.556
and shift all of this creativity,

00:09:08.556 --> 00:09:09.756
inventiveness,

00:09:09.756 --> 00:09:11.996
knowledge and influence

00:09:11.996 --> 00:09:13.516
towards fixing climate change.

00:09:14.396 --> 00:09:17.316
And then this invisible

00:09:17.316 --> 00:09:19.516
and intangible

00:09:19.516 --> 00:09:24.076
and incredibly influential X industry

00:09:24.076 --> 00:09:27.116
can finally stop being part of the problem

00:09:27.116 --> 00:09:28.716
and become part of the solution.

00:09:29.276 --> 00:09:30.276
Thank you.